---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/subpage.css';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="FAQ | Cleaning Jobs NZ"
  description="Frequently asked questions about applying for cleaning work, eligibility, allocation, and the Spruce standard."
  path="/faq/"
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/faq/#webpage",
    "url": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/faq/",
    "name": "Frequently asked questions | Cleaning Jobs NZ",
    "inLanguage": "en-NZ",
    "isPartOf": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/#website" },
    "about": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/#organization" },
    "publisher": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/#organization" },
    "breadcrumb": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/faq/#breadcrumb" },
    "mainEntity": [
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do I apply?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Apply online through the form on this site. It takes a few minutes \u2014 you\u2019ll tell us your location, experience, transport, and the type of cleaning work you\u2019re suited for. You only need to apply once."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Do I need cleaning experience?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Experience is preferred but not always required. Reliability, attention to detail, and willingness to follow checklists matter just as much. The Spruce certification process is there to bring you up to speed."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Do I need my own transport?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Transport is often preferred, especially for residential work spread across an area. Some commercial roles may be accessible by public transport. We\u2019ll ask about your situation in the application."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Do I need my own equipment?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "It depends on the type of work. Residential cleans often require basic equipment; commercial sites frequently supply their own. The specifics are covered during onboarding."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Can teams apply?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Yes. You can apply as an individual, a small team, or a cleaning partnership. There\u2019s an option to indicate this in the application."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Is there a cost to apply?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "No. Applying is free. Spruce onboarding and training are part of becoming eligible for work, and any specifics are explained before you start."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Is work guaranteed?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "No. We don\u2019t guarantee a minimum number of jobs. Work depends on location, demand, availability, suitability, and certification. What we offer is a clear, structured process for becoming eligible for it."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How is work allocated?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Once you\u2019re certified, you\u2019re considered for suitable work based on location, demand, availability, and certification. The mix and amount of work vary by area."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Is this employment or contractor work?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "The working arrangement varies by role and is confirmed during onboarding. We\u2019ll be clear about the arrangement before any work is allocated to you."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What areas are available?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Recruitment is demand-led, so availability depends on where there\u2019s current demand for work. Apply with your location and we\u2019ll let you know if there\u2019s a suitable next step in your area."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "When will I hear back?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We review every application individually and contact you if there\u2019s a suitable next step. Timing depends on current demand in your area."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What is Spruce certification?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "A short training or assessment against the Spruce standard. It ensures everyone working in the network delivers a consistent quality of clean, with clear checklists and shared expectations."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What is the Spruce standard?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "A shared way of working: training, room-by-room checklists, practical expectations, and quality checks that are the same across every Spruce job."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How long does onboarding take?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "It depends on your experience, availability, and the work types you\u2019re applying for. We\u2019ll give you an indication after reviewing your application."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
  </script>
  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/faq/#breadcrumb",
    "itemListElement": [
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": 1,
        "name": "Home",
        "item": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/"
      },
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": 2,
        "name": "FAQ",
        "item": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/faq/"
      }
    ]
  }
  </script>
  </Fragment>

  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
        <h1>Frequently asked questions.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Answers to the questions people ask before applying. Can&rsquo;t see yours? <a href="mailto:hello@cleaningjobs.co.nz">Email us</a>.</p>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/apply/">Apply now <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/how-it-works/">How it works</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block faq-block" id="faq">
      <div class="wrap">
      <div class="faq-group">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">Applying</span>
          <h2>Applying for cleaning work</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>How do I apply?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>Apply online through the form on this site. It takes a few minutes. You’ll tell us your location, experience, transport, and the type of cleaning work you’re suited for. You only need to apply once.</p></div></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Do I need cleaning experience?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>Experience is preferred but not always required. Reliability, attention to detail, and willingness to follow checklists matter just as much. The Spruce certification process is there to bring you up to speed.</p></div></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Do I need my own transport?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>Transport is often preferred, especially for residential work spread across an area. Some commercial roles may be accessible by public transport. We’ll ask about your situation in the application.</p></div></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Do I need my own equipment?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>It depends on the type of work. Residential cleans often require basic equipment; commercial sites frequently supply their own. The specifics are covered during onboarding.</p></div></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Can teams apply?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>Yes. You can apply as an individual, a small team, or a cleaning partnership. There’s an option to indicate this in the application.</p></div></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Is there a cost to apply?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>No. Applying is free. Spruce onboarding and training are part of becoming eligible for work, and any specifics are explained before you start.</p></div></details>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-group">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">Work &amp; allocation</span>
          <h2>Work, eligibility &amp; allocation</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Is work guaranteed?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>No. We don’t guarantee a minimum number of jobs. Work depends on location, demand, availability, suitability, and certification. What we offer is a clear, structured process for becoming eligible for it.</p></div></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>How is work allocated?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>Once you’re certified, you’re considered for suitable work based on location, demand, availability, and certification. The mix and amount of work vary by area.</p></div></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Is this employment or contractor work?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>The working arrangement varies by role and is confirmed during onboarding. We’ll be clear about the arrangement before any work is allocated to you.</p></div></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>What areas are available?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>Recruitment is demand-led, so availability depends on where there’s current demand for work. Apply with your location and we’ll let you know if there’s a suitable next step in your area.</p></div></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>When will I hear back?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>We review every application individually and contact you if there’s a suitable next step. Timing depends on current demand in your area.</p></div></details>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-group">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">Standards &amp; onboarding</span>
          <h2>The Spruce standard &amp; onboarding</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>What is Spruce certification?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>A short training or assessment against the Spruce standard. It ensures everyone working in the network delivers a consistent quality of clean, with clear checklists and shared expectations.</p></div></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>What is the Spruce standard?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>A shared way of working: training, room-by-room checklists, practical expectations, and quality checks that are the same across every Spruce job.</p></div></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>How long does onboarding take?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>It depends on your experience, availability, and the work types you’re applying for. We’ll give you an indication after reviewing your application.</p></div></details>
        </div>
      </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-band" id="apply-cta">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Ready to apply?</h2>
        <p>Tell us where you&rsquo;re based, your experience, and the type of cleaning work you&rsquo;re suited for. We&rsquo;ll review your application and contact you if there&rsquo;s a suitable next step.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/apply/">Start application
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="btn btn-on-dark" href="/how-it-works/">See how it works</a>
        </div>
        <p class="small-note">Work is not guaranteed. Allocation depends on demand, suitability, availability, and certification.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
